WEBVTT

00:01:59.699 --> 00:02:02.535
we ran a program
where girls lived at SOLA

00:02:02.577 --> 00:02:05.746
but primarily studied
at high schools in Kabul.

00:02:06.205 --> 00:02:08.791
And we secured scholarships
for these girls

00:02:08.791 --> 00:02:11.002
to pursue their education overseas,

00:02:11.043 --> 00:02:12.795
including here in America.

00:02:13.629 --> 00:02:14.922
It worked.

00:02:14.964 --> 00:02:16.591
It worked well.

00:02:17.425 --> 00:02:21.304
But I realized I was contributing
to something I never wanted to see:

00:02:21.971 --> 00:02:25.099
a brain drain of Afghanistan’s
educated women.

00:02:26.058 --> 00:02:28.019
So I realized I had to adapt.

00:02:28.477 --> 00:02:31.480
I wanted to educate Afghan girls